# Build cache. Never commit this.
#
# Besides the compiled Swift helpers and scratch PNGs, it holds font subsets
# extracted from the source PDF so their glyphs can be outlined. Those are
# fragments of commercial fonts (FatFrank, Houschka Rounded) that this project
# does not license, so they stay local: the SVGs the build produces contain
# outlined paths, which is artwork, not font software.
.bin/
